      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BILL PEYTO (2) is in the veteran class now but hard to knock the recent form with a fast finishing win two back then a near miss from last at Moree latest. Will be winding up late and tough to stop again. MARALAGO (10) has been thereabouts without winning. Will find this easier, senior rider goes on and gets chance to show best. GLORYESS (6) improved last time out, finishing a long neck from the winner in second at the end of 1450m at this track. Ready for the longer trip now. Well placed to run top-three again. CAPTAIN INSANO (5) did little and finished 6 lengths from the winner in eighth over 2000m at this track last start. Back to a mile and may be worth another chance. BIT OF A STEP (7) placed last time at the mile which was here and can do better than last start when missed the frame but not beaten far.",
